[TITLE]
NUM-16: seven identical storage units, each draining through a 90-degree V-notch weir
(TRIANGULAR 2 ft high x 4 ft wide, Cd 2.5, crest 1 ft) whose setting is fixed by a rule:
W1..W7 = 1, 0.999, 0.99, 0.95, 0.9, 0.75, 0.5. Inflow 2 cfs to each.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
REPORT_START_DATE    01/01/2020
REPORT_START_TIME    00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2020
END_TIME             12:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:15:00
WET_STEP             00:05:00
DRY_STEP             01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         5

[STORAGE]
;;Name Elev MaxDepth InitDepth Shape     Coeff Expon Const SurDepth Fevap
S1     100  10       0         FUNCTIONAL 0     0     1000  0        0
S2     100  10       0         FUNCTIONAL 0     0     1000  0        0
S3     100  10       0         FUNCTIONAL 0     0     1000  0        0
S4     100  10       0         FUNCTIONAL 0     0     1000  0        0
S5     100  10       0         FUNCTIONAL 0     0     1000  0        0
S6     100  10       0         FUNCTIONAL 0     0     1000  0        0
S7     100  10       0         FUNCTIONAL 0     0     1000  0        0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type  Stage Gated
O1      90    FREE        NO
O2      90    FREE        NO
O3      90    FREE        NO
O4      90    FREE        NO
O5      90    FREE        NO
O6      90    FREE        NO
O7      90    FREE        NO

[WEIRS]
;;Name From To  Type    CrestHt Cd  Gated EC
W1      S1   O1  V-NOTCH 1       2.5 NO    0
W2      S2   O2  V-NOTCH 1       2.5 NO    0
W3      S3   O3  V-NOTCH 1       2.5 NO    0
W4      S4   O4  V-NOTCH 1       2.5 NO    0
W5      S5   O5  V-NOTCH 1       2.5 NO    0
W6      S6   O6  V-NOTCH 1       2.5 NO    0
W7      S7   O7  V-NOTCH 1       2.5 NO    0

[XSECTIONS]
W1      TRIANGULAR 2  4  0  0
W2      TRIANGULAR 2  4  0  0
W3      TRIANGULAR 2  4  0  0
W4      TRIANGULAR 2  4  0  0
W5      TRIANGULAR 2  4  0  0
W6      TRIANGULAR 2  4  0  0
W7      TRIANGULAR 2  4  0  0

[INFLOWS]
;;Node Param TSeries Type Mfactor Sfactor Baseline
S1     FLOW  ""      FLOW 1.0     1.0     2
S2     FLOW  ""      FLOW 1.0     1.0     2
S3     FLOW  ""      FLOW 1.0     1.0     2
S4     FLOW  ""      FLOW 1.0     1.0     2
S5     FLOW  ""      FLOW 1.0     1.0     2
S6     FLOW  ""      FLOW 1.0     1.0     2
S7     FLOW  ""      FLOW 1.0     1.0     2

[CONTROLS]
RULE R1
IF SIMULATION TIME > 0
THEN WEIR W1 SETTING = 1

RULE R2
IF SIMULATION TIME > 0
THEN WEIR W2 SETTING = 0.999

RULE R3
IF SIMULATION TIME > 0
THEN WEIR W3 SETTING = 0.99

RULE R4
IF SIMULATION TIME > 0
THEN WEIR W4 SETTING = 0.95

RULE R5
IF SIMULATION TIME > 0
THEN WEIR W5 SETTING = 0.9

RULE R6
IF SIMULATION TIME > 0
THEN WEIR W6 SETTING = 0.75

RULE R7
IF SIMULATION TIME > 0
THEN WEIR W7 SETTING = 0.5

[REPORT]
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
